{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type UseBaseMutationResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> = Override<MutationObserverResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>, {\n  mutate: UseMutateFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;\n}> & object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/types.ts#L453","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/react-query/src/types.ts:453"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The result of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useMutation"},{"type":"text","value":". Same as "},{"type":"link","href":"MutationObserverResult.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"MutationObserverResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/query-core"},{"type":"text","value":", with\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutate"},{"type":"text","value":" narrowed to the fire-and-forget "},{"type":"link","href":"UseMutateFunction.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"UseMutateFunction"}]},{"type":"text","value":" signature, plus the added "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutateAsync"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-declaration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Declaration"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"mutateasync","children":[{"type":"text","value":"mutateAsync"}]},{"type":"code","value":"mutateAsync: UseMutateAsyncFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Similar to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutate"},{"type":"text","value":", but returns a promise which can be awaited."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type your mutation function resolves to."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of errors your mutation function may throw."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvariables","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TVariables"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TVariables"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of the variable passed to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutate"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutateAsync"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tonmutateresult","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TOnMutateResult"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOnMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutate"},{"type":"text","value":", passed to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSuccess"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onError"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSettled"},{"type":"text","value":" as\ntheir "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-declaration","text":"Type Declaration","level":2},{"id":"mutateasync","text":"mutateAsync","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tvariables","text":"TVariables","level":3},{"id":"tonmutateresult","text":"TOnMutateResult","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype UseBaseMutationResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> = Override<MutationObserverResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>, {\n  mutate: UseMutateFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;\n}> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-query/src/types.ts:453](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/types.ts#L453)\n\nThe result of `useMutation`. Same as [MutationObserverResult](MutationObserverResult.md) from `@tanstack/query-core`, with\n`mutate` narrowed to the fire-and-forget [UseMutateFunction](UseMutateFunction.md) signature, plus the added `mutateAsync`.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### mutateAsync\n\n```ts\nmutateAsync: UseMutateAsyncFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;\n```\n\nSimilar to `mutate`, but returns a promise which can be awaited.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your mutation function resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your mutation function may throw.\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `unknown`\n\nThe type of the variable passed to `mutate`/`mutateAsync`.\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\nThe type returned by `onMutate`, passed to `onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled` as\ntheir `onMutateResult` parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: UseBaseMutationResult\ntitle: UseBaseMutationResult\n---\n\n```ts\ntype UseBaseMutationResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> = Override<MutationObserverResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>, {\n  mutate: UseMutateFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;\n}> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-query/src/types.ts:453](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/types.ts#L453)\n\nThe result of `useMutation`. Same as [MutationObserverResult](MutationObserverResult.md) from `@tanstack/query-core`, with\n`mutate` narrowed to the fire-and-forget [UseMutateFunction](UseMutateFunction.md) signature, plus the added `mutateAsync`.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### mutateAsync\n\n```ts\nmutateAsync: UseMutateAsyncFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;\n```\n\nSimilar to `mutate`, but returns a promise which can be awaited.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your mutation function resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your mutation function may throw.\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `unknown`\n\nThe type of the variable passed to `mutate`/`mutateAsync`.\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\nThe type returned by `onMutate`, passed to `onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled` as\ntheir `onMutateResult` parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data.\n"}
